,U)\">\\(e\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(V,U)\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" href=\"?note=8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" title=\"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism\">14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsEpi}_{\\mathcal E}(e)\">\\(\\operatorname{IsEpi}_{\\mathcal E}(e)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(U,M_{\\vec x})\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(U,M_{\\vec x})\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Forces}_{\\mathcal E,M,\\vec x}(U,\\alpha,\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Forces}_{\\mathcal E,M,\\vec x}(V,\\alpha\\circ e,\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Forces}_{\\mathcal E,M,\\vec x}(U,\\alpha,\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Forces}_{\\mathcal E,M,\\vec x}(V,\\alpha\\circ e,\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正向为<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4243cdd0b878c5d4\" href=\"?note=4243cdd0b878c5d4\" title=\"14-thm-forcing-persistence\">14-thm-forcing-persistence</a>；反向由 χφαe=⊤!Ue，沿满射 e 右消去得 χφα=⊤!U。有限或小联合满射族的版本在余积存在时由取其余积箭头得到。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-kripke-joyal-forcing","status":"resolved","id":"eeccd7d0ab927af1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-kripke-joyal-forcing]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-forcing-persistence","status":"resolved","id":"4243cdd0b878c5d4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-forcing-persistence]]","embed":fals